    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d404">

                <pb facs="0597" n="477" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg477"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The British Ambassador to
                        Acting Secretary of State Adee.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >British Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Lenox,
                            Mass.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-09-25"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">September 25, 1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 193.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to Mr. O’Beirne’s note No.
                    99 of the 9th of May [not printed], I have the honor to transmit to you herewith
                    a revised list of the staff of His Serene Highness Prince Louis of Battenberg
                    and of the captains of the ships of the second cruiser squadron who will
                    accompany the rear-admiral on his forthcoming visit to Washington.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">H. M. Durand.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d404-a1.xml" xpointer="d404-a1"/>
